[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-portugal-government-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-164":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},164,"portugal-government-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-164","Portugal Government Scholarship 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>Portugal Government Scholarship: Shall we explore the possibility of a fully-funded scholarship in Europe?\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Applications are now being accepted from all qualified and interested international students for the 2026 fully funded Portugal Government Scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Portugal Government Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Portugal Government\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-europe\u002F\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Portugal\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fphd-scholarships\u002F\">PhD Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>€15,000 Stipend\u002FYr \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: September 30, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Portugal Government Scholarship 2026 Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Government of Portugal are offering fully funded scholarship opportunities to international students willing to study in the European country.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Portugal Government Scholarship are awarded for the entire academic year and are paid monthly, usually in 10 instalments.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The purpose of grants is to provide support to students with limited financial resources so that they can pay the costs of higher education.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Portugal Government Scholarship 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Covers all tuition fees.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Provides a monthly stipend of €15,000\u002FYr  for living expenses.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Access to top universities in Europe.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Exposure to excellent academic resources and faculty.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Opportunity to immerse in Portugal’s rich cultural heritage.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Chance to learn a new language and build a global network.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Enhances employability with a degree from a prestigious Portuguese university.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Opens doors to diverse professional paths both in Portugal and internationally.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Supports academic growth.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fosters overall personal and professional development.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Portugal Government Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate and postgraduate Portugal Government Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The scholarship is open to international students from all countries.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Undergraduate Programs require completion of secondary education.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Master’s Programs: Require possession of a Bachelor’s degree or equivalent.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Doctoral Programs: Requires possession of a Master’s degree or equivalent.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants should demonstrate proficiency in Portuguese or English, depending on the language of instruction of the chosen program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Demonstrated academic merit and potential for success in the chosen field of study.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for Portugal Government Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Portugal Government Scholarship 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to visit the scholarship website.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to visit the scholarship application webpage\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Grant applications can only be made online. During the application process, you will need to upload some documents.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Go to the \u003Ca class=\"wpel-icon-right\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.dges.gov.pt\u002Fwwwbeon\u002F\">student’s restricted area on the DGES website\u003C\u002Fa>, enter your login details (user code and password), and submit the application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Feportugal.gov.pt\u002Fen\u002Fservicos\u002Fcandidatar-se-a-uma-bolsa-de-estudo-para-o-ensino-superior\">https:\u002F\u002Feportugal.gov.pt\u002Fen\u002Fservicos\u002Fcandidatar-se-a-uma-bolsa-de-estudo-para-o-ensino-superior\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-21 10:38:42",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fportugal-government-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69e745a219a4e9.73017602_screenshot 2026-04-21 103454.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fportugal-government-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69e745a219a4e9.73017602_screenshot%202026-04-21%20103454.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-